Error [E0339]: `attack` is a computed field — it can't be assigned
  --> tests/ui/computed_field_set.jet:8:31
    |
  8 |     s := Stats.{strength: 10, attack: 5}
    |                               ^^^^^^
 Why: `attack` is declared `attack => …` — its value always comes from that formula; `#Memo` only retains the result between valid reads
 Fix: change a stored field the `attack` formula reads, not `attack` itself
